{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2021-08-17 08:00:00', 'title': 'PEPSICO ANNOUNCES "NET WATER POSITIVE" COMMITMENT', 'text': 'PURCHASE, N.Y., AUG. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY,\xa0PEPSICO, INC. (NASDAQ:PEP)\xa0ANNOUNCED ITS AMBITION TO BECOME "NET WATER POSITIVE" BY 2030,\xa0 AIMING TO\xa0REPLENISH MORE WATER THAN THE COMPANY USES, WHICH WOULD PLACE IT\xa0AMONG THE MOST WATER-EFFICIENT FOOD OR BEVERAGE MANUFACTURERS OPERATING IN HIGH-RISK WATERSHEDS.'}